INSTRUCTIONS.md
PHASE*-INSTRUCTIONS.md
PHASE*-LAB*.md
flaws_petite.md

# Python cruft
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/*.egg-info
.venv
venv
.env
.env.*

# If you add tests later
tests
**/conftest.py
